axolotlclient-oldanimations=Old Animations

enabled=Enabled

useAndMine=Use and Mine Animation
useAndMine.tooltip=Animates the item while the player holds <br>down right mouse button then left mouse <br>button while aiming at the ground.

useAndMineParticles=Use and Mine Particles
useAndMineParticles.tooltip=Visually shows mining progress <br>particles while the player is holding both <br>mouse buttons.

blockHitting=Block-Hitting Animation
blockHitting.tooltip=Animates the item while the player <br>clicks both mouse buttons.

itemPositions=Item Positions
itemPositions.tooltip=Applies transformations to held items <br>to place them in the same positions <br>they were in 1.7.

secondLayerDamageTint=Second Layer Damage Tint
secondLayerDamageTint.tooltip=Applies the damage tint to the <br>second layer of entities. This means that <br>the player's armor, spider eyes, and endermen <br>eyes will be tinted.

smoothSneaking=Smooth Sneaking (First Person)
smoothSneaking.tooltip=Smoothly interpolates the player's <br>changing eye height as they sneak.

heartFlashing=Heart Flashing
heartFlashing.tooltip=Stops the filled-in heart overlay <br>from showing in the hotbar while taking damage.

show1_7_10=Replace 1.8.9 Text with 1.7.10
show1_7_10.tooltip=Replaces the 1.8.9 version number with <br>1.7.10 within various facets of the game. <br>This includes the debug menu, title screen, and display title!

debugInfo=Debug Info
debugInfo.tooltip=Use debug information found in the 1.7 debug menu.

disableDebugBackground=Disable Background
disableDebugBackground.tooltip=Disables the background on text.

debugCrosshair=Show Crosshair
debugCrosshair.tooltip=Replaces the axis indicator with the regular crosshair.

debugTextSpacing=Text Spacing
debugTextSpacing.tooltip=Spaces the text in a manner that is identical to 1.7.

debugTextColorScheme=Color Scheme
debugTextColorScheme.tooltip=Applies the mismatched color scheme of the 1.7 debug menu

debugTextShadow=Enable Text Shadow
debugTextShadow.tooltip=Enables text shadow.

thirdPersonSmoothSneaking=Smooth Sneaking (Third Person)
thirdPersonSmoothSneaking.tooltip=Smoothly interpolates the player's model <br>position as they sneak. Only viewable while <br>in the third person perspective.

allowMiningCancel=Cancel Mining by Using
allowMiningCancel.tooltip=Allows the player to "cancel" <br>their mining progress by using an item.

damageColor=Damage Tint Color
damageColor.tooltip=Applies the old damage tint color. <br>This color is possible by porting the 1.7 damage tint rendering!

stickRod=Replace Cast Fishing Rod Texture With Stick Texture
stickRod.tooltip=Replaces the cast fishing rod texture <br>with the stick texture while in third person mode. <br>Weirdly a feature in 1.7.

blockingArm=Third Person Sword Blocking Arm
blockingArm.tooltip=Positions the blocking arm in a <br>manner that replicates 1.7.

fastItems=Fast Items
fastItems.tooltip=Flattens dropped/hotbar items to appear 2D. <br>This may increase performance just like it did in 1.7!

mirroredProjectiles=Mirrored Projectiles
mirroredProjectiles.tooltip=Mirrors projectiles so that <br>they face the correct direction! <br>This is a bug in 1.8.

disableAlexModel=Disable Alex Skin Model
disableAlexModel.tooltip=Disables the alex skin model as <br>it does not exist in vanilla 1.7!

disableSkinLayers=Disable Skin Layers Except Hat Layer
disableSkinLayers.tooltip=Disables all skin layers except the hat layer, <br>as only the hat layer exists in 1.7!

flameOffset=Player Flame Offset
flameOffset.tooltip=Offsets the flame (when set on fire) of the player. <br>Only viewable on your player! <br>This is a bug in 1.7.

disableTitles=Disable In-Game Titles
disableTitles.tooltip=Disables in-game titles as they don't exist in 1.7.

oldItemPickup=Item Pickup Offset
oldItemPickup.tooltip=Offsets the item pickup animation to match 1.7.

oldPickupArm=Fix Item Pickup Arm Rotation
oldPickupArm.tooltip=Fixes an incorrect rotation of the player <br>arm whenever an item is picked up <br>while viewed from the first person perspective. <br>This is a bug in 1.8.

oldGlint=Glint Rotation/Scale
oldGlint.tooltip=Rotates and scales the enchantment glint's <br>texture coordinates to match 1.7's glint rendering.

oldGuiGlint=Glint in GUI
oldGuiGlint.tooltip=Renders the enchantment glint in <br>the GUI in a manner that matches 1.7.

oldGlintColor=Glint Color Schemes
oldGlintColor.tooltip=Uses the 1.7 enchantment glint color scheme.

centeredSelectionMenus=Centered Selection Menus
centeredSelectionMenus.tooltip=Centers selection menus such that <br>they start from the middle of the screen. <br>Affects the multiplayer, singleplayer, and modmenu screens!

tabDimensions=Player List Dimensions
tabDimensions.tooltip=Replicates the dimensions and behaviors <br>of the player list menu. The boxes, <br>width, and length mimic 1.7.

disableTabPlayerHeads=Disable Player Heads
disableTabPlayerHeads.tooltip=Stops rendering player heads.

disableTabHeader=Disable Header
disableTabHeader.tooltip=Disables the header section.

disableTabFooter=Disable Footer
disableTabFooter.tooltip=Disables the footer section.

equipLogic=Item Equip Animation Logic
equipLogic.tooltip=Replicates the equip animation played <br>by switching items within the player's inventory or hotbar.

oldDamageTick=Damage Animation Logic
oldDamageTick.tooltip=For some reason in 1.7, the damage animation <br>(hurt tilt, damage tint, etc) are ahead slightly. <br>This option replicates that behavior!

oldSwingVisual=Swing During Miss Penalty
oldSwingVisual.tooltip=Visually swings the player's arm during <br>during the miss penalty. In 1.7, the miss <br>penalty does not affect combat, so this option sort of <br>emulates that behavior but without touching combat.

oldSwingVisualParticles=Show Particles on Missed Hits
oldSwingVisualParticles.tooltip=Visually shows particles (criticals, sharpness, etc) <br>during missed hits given the appropriate conditions.

slowUpSneak=Slow Sneak-Up Animation
slowUpSneak.tooltip=Makes the sneaking up animation slow to match 1.7

stopLineTranslateSneak=Stop Fishing Rod Line Translation while Sneaking
stopLineTranslateSneak.tooltip=Stops the fishing rod's line from <br>translating down while sneaking. <br>Only viewable while in the third person perspective.

fixCameraPitch=Fix Camera Pitch Bug
fixCameraPitch.tooltip=Fixes the camera pitch being incorrect <br>while in the third person perspective. <br>Affects projectiles, nametags, etc. This is a bug in 1.8!

oldPotionGlint=Only Render Glint On Potion Overlay
oldPotionGlint.tooltip=Only renders the enchantment glint on <br>the overlay of the potion. This behavior only <br>occurs for the item while it is held in 1.7.

replaceSkullModel=Use Old Skull Model
replaceSkullModel.tooltip=Uses the old entity skull model <br>and texture for skull items (not blocks).

xpOrbPosition=XP Orb Offset
xpOrbPosition.tooltip=Offsets the XP orb's position. <br>This is a bug in 1.7!

disableServerSelectionButtons=Disable Server List Selection Buttons
disableServerSelectionButtons.tooltip=Disables the server list selection <br>buttons in the multiplayer menu as <br>they don't exist in 1.7!

disableUnknownServerIcon=Remove Unknown Server Icon
disableUnknownServerIcon.tooltip=Removes the unknown server icon in <br>the multiplayer menu as it does not exist in 1.7.

disableSkinCustomizationButton=Disable Skin Customization Button
disableSkinCustomizationButton.tooltip=Removes the skin customization settings page <br>within the in-game settings as skin layers <br>don't exist in 1.7. Intended to be paired with <br>the "disableSkinLayers" feature.

oldMultiplayerSettingsPage=Old Multiplayer Settings Page
oldMultiplayerSettingsPage.tooltip=Brings back the multiplayer settings <br>page which replaces the chat settings page. <br>Intended to be paired with the "disableSkinLayers" and <br>"disableSkinCustomizationButton" features.
